oop on Rocker Trail","subtitle":"Above campus · South Dakota Mines","notes":"Use a marked trailhead near O’Harra Stadium or Connolly Hall for a daylight walk, run, or bike ride; bring water and stay on route.","short_summary":"A three-mile campus-adjacent trail with marked access points and Rapid City views.","evidence_claim":"South Dakota Mines says Rocker Trail is a three-mile walking, running, and biking loop above campus with multiple signed access points, including near O’Harra Stadium.","source_url":"https://www.sdsmt.edu/news/releases/rocker-trail-opens.html","source_title":"South Dakota Mines Hosts Ribbon Cutting for New Trail Above Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2022-10-12","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use marked access points in daylight and follow trail conditions and posted guidance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sdsmt-king-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"King Center","title":"Locate the King Center","subtitle":"Campus · South Dakota Mines","notes":"Walk through the athletics and recreation hub to identify the wellness area, bouldering wall, gym, and courts for future student recreation.","short_summary":"A campus athletics-and-recreation orientation stop.","evidence_claim":"South Dakota Mines describes King Center as its athletics hub, with a wellness center, fitness area, bouldering wall, Goodell Gym, and squash and racquetball courts.","source_url":"https://www.sdsmt.edu/admissions-aid/visit-mines/virtual-tour.html","source_title":"South Dakota Mines Virtual Tour & Campus Highlights","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility and event access can vary; check current recreation or athletics information before participating.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"s